data-driven. In these guides, you can find everything you need to build powerful integrations,
automations and data pipelines on top of Attio.</span>
<span data-as="p">Our docs cover guides, examples, references and code to help you build apps and share them with
Attio’s customers or for your own workspace.</span>
<span data-as="p">The Attio Developer Platform consists of four parts:</span>
